{"unit_id": "Yuuz12__dsh-tavily#feature-1", "repo": "Yuuz12/dsh-tavily", "commit": "9c98315e831faa0a45d55ca8a4f46ae1560e4385", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-tavily 的功能「Tavily 网页搜索」：将 DSH web 搜索请求发送到 Tavily，并把搜索结果映射为 DSH 提供方响应。模型发起网页搜索时自动触发，可配置搜索深度、主题、结果数和摘要回答。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:412-434", "index.js:779-804"]}
